---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base profile description="十年 Web 开发，从 PHP 到跨端。探索人与 AI 共生时代，创造、生活与工作的新方式。">
  <section class="pt-6 sm:pt-10" aria-labelledby="profile-heading">
    <div class="mb-6 flex size-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface font-mono text-[36px] tracking-[-3px] text-accent" aria-hidden="true">a.</div>
    <h1 id="profile-heading" class="text-4xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-[42px]">Airfisher</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">软件工程师 · 10 年 Web 开发</p>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-base leading-[1.9] text-ink">
      <p>从 PHP 到跨端，关注视觉、交互与软件工程。</p>
      <p>探索人与 AI 共生时代，创造、生活与工作的新方式。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="mt-9 space-y-3" aria-label="了解更多">
    <a href="/posts/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface/40 p-5 hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface focus-visible:outline-offset-4">
      <span class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-line bg-page text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6zM15 3v5h4M9 12h7M9 16h5"/></svg>
      </span>
      <span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-base font-semibold text-ink">文章</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">技术实践与日常思考</span></span>
      <span class="text-muted group-hover:text-accent" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/airfisher" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface/40 p-5 hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-surface focus-visible:outline-offset-4">
      <span class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-line bg-page font-mono text-lg text-accent" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span>
      <span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-base font-semibold text-ink">GitHub</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">代码与项目</span></span>
      <span class="text-muted group-hover:text-accent" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </nav>
  <p class="mt-6 text-center text-sm text-muted"><a href="/rss.xml" class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent">通过 RSS 订阅文章</a></p>
</Base>
